{"sections":[{"slug":"Lax方程","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"Lax方程"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"“Lax <span lang=\"zh\">方程</span>”"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"“Lax 方程”"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Plain":"\n<p>Lax <span lang=\"zh\">方程是形如</span>\n$$\r\n\\frac{dL}{dt} = [M,L]\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">的方程</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">其中</span> $L,M$ <span lang=\"zh\">为线性算子</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">它是方程组</span>\n$$\r\n\\begin{aligned}\r\n\t\\lambda \\psi &amp;= L \\psi \\\\\r\n\t\\frac{d\\psi}{dt} &amp;= M\\psi\r\n\\end{aligned}\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">的相容性条件</span>.</p>\n"}}}]}